  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 104.25 Soft bank stabilization components",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 104.25 “Soft bank stabilization components” means deformable materials used in soft vegetative or bioengineered bank stabilization. The term includes but is not limited to coconut fiber rolls, jute mats, live plantings, and logs.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1, #2, #3, and #4 at Chapter heading for Env-Wt 100) #12801, eff 12-15-19; renumbered by #13945 (formerly Env-Wt 104.23)",
